Adam Borowski <kilobyte@mimuw.edu.pl> writes:

> On Thu, 9 Dec 2004, Martin Read wrote:
> > Vampire mages would be good; it might make 'V' marginally worth worrying
> > about for anyone past about XL10.
> 
> It's just the effect of magic cancellation and AC which makes vampires 
